    "c3": {
      "anchor": "p-numbers-with-units",
      "kind": "phase",
      "label": "Numbers With Units",
      "excerpt": "Numbers With Units",
      "text": "Take e.g. `2' 3 1/2\"`",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-04T00:26:41.586Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-04T00:57:37.730Z",
          "html": "<p>Added to P23 (marked Q26):  a written measure reads as its dimension, so <code>2' 3 1/2\"</code> is a length (2 feet, 3½ inches), as are <code>172 cm</code> and <code>5 ft 8 in</code>.  The catch:  <code>\"</code> starts text and <code>'</code> is the possessive today, so a <code>'</code> or <code>\"</code> straight after a number, no space, reads as feet or inches;  everything else is unchanged.  The plan waits for your accept again.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-04T00:55:09.002Z"
      }
    },
    "c4": {
      "anchor": "p-units-the-person-reads",
      "kind": "phase",
      "label": "Units the Person Reads",
      "excerpt": "Units the Person Reads",
      "text": "Default is to convert to their determined (or preference) units.\nWe can have `<ui-dimension length in=\"feet and inches\">` to convert in the UI\nWithout `in`, do something like `2' 4\"`",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-04T00:27:01.076Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-04T00:57:38.913Z",
          "html": "<p>Added to P24 (marked Q27):  by default every measure shows in the reader's units, from their region or their preference;  and <code>&lt;ui-dimension value={its height} in=\"feet and inches\"&gt;</code>, a Spell UI element showing one measure, <code>in=</code> choosing the units.  Its dimension comes from the value's type, or <code>length=\"172\" unit=\"cm\"</code> for a bare number.  The plan waits for your accept again.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-04T00:55:09.637Z"
      }
    }
  },
